<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h3>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><span style="color: #0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Case%20keyword" title="Case keyword (page does not exist)">case</a></span> EVENT_TYPE_GUI_OPENED:<br />{<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nGUIID = <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetEventInteger" title="GetEventInteger">GetEventInteger</a>(ev, <span style="color: #7F007F;">0</span>); <span style="color: #007F00; font-style: italic;">// ID number of the GUI that was opened</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#007F00; font-style:italic;">// insert event-handling code here</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Break%20keyword" title="Break keyword (page does not exist)">break</a></span>;<br />}</div>
<p>GUI tutorial calls. nGUIID can be:
</p>
<ul><li>GUI_INVENTORY: //Inventory ScreenOpened</li>
<li>GUI_JOURNAL: //Journal</li>
<li>GUI_MAP: //Area Map</li>
<li>GUI_WORLD_MAP: //World Map</li>
<li>GUI_TACTICS: //AI Tactics screen</li>
<li>GUI_STORE: //Store GUI</li>
<li>GUI_CRAFTING: //Crafting</li>
<li>GUI_CHANTERS: //Chanter's Board</li>
<li>GUI_ITEM_UPGRADE // Enchanter upgrade</li></ul>
<p>See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GUI" title="GUI *">GUI_*</a> for a complete list of GUI constants.
</p>
